{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>深水埗警區特別職務隊昨日（18日）在油麻地廟街打擊毒品。警員於一個懷疑被用作毒品倉庫的唐樓單位，檢獲約900克懷疑氯胺酮及約70克懷疑可卡因，並以涉嫌「販運危險藥物」拘捕一名25歲非華裔男子，他現正被扣留調查。行動中檢獲的毒品總市值約50萬。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.761031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:47:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T20:57:26.311101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:33.358803+00:00","content_hash":"85ab442d58854e0702b50383c25b77f47e6966c3f04e73ac002441c71195e546","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}